  "interpretation": [
    "Both real backends report raw base/support intersection at normal mounting; only the qualified fixed-base/support pair is allowed.",
    "Moving the diagnostic base down 1 mm fails unchanged-mount, plane, footprint-height and full-base half-space checks in both backends. The frozen task layout is not changed.",
    "At simulation J2=2.4 rad both backends detect s50_link_2/mount_plinth collision, and neither grants it permission.",
    "Coal negative raw min_distance is backend output, not a certified penetration-depth measurement. Native contact counts are capped; matching counts do not prove equal contact manifolds.",
    "Small area differences reflect separate mesh loaders/numeric representation; source models and diagnostic outcomes match, but exact equality of all loaded vertices was not asserted here.",
    "These probes do not check mechanical joint limits, tool installation, whole-scene or whole-pose acceptance, task readiness, dynamics or physical installation clocking."
  ],
